# Pilldue

Medication refill tracker. Log therapy schedules and know when each med needs a refill.

## Current state

- Early repository scaffold only — no application project yet.
- UI approach is undecided: console TUI vs WPF. Do not assume either.
- Application source will live under `src/` once a project type is chosen.

## Conventions

- Prefer updating `docs/` when repository structure or decisions change.
- Keep Cursor guidance in `.cursor/rules/` and project skills in `.cursor/skills/`.
- Do not scaffold a .NET solution or lock UI tech unless the user asks.
